WEBVTT

00:02.450 --> 00:04.290
HIKAGE DOJO

00:33.940 --> 00:35.200
Cheer up.

00:35.800 --> 00:37.040
State your name.

00:37.380 --> 00:38.940
My name is Naka Hikage.

00:39.420 --> 00:40.180
Right.

00:40.560 --> 00:42.360
What is your older brother's name?

00:43.280 --> 00:45.820
My brother's name is

00:46.260 --> 00:47.920
Take Hikage.

00:48.560 --> 00:49.691
Correct.

00:49.692 --> 00:54.320
We siblings, as the descendants of the Hikage-ryu
martial arts with a 300-year history,

00:54.980 --> 00:58.900
must continuously train
with strict self-discipline.

00:58.900 --> 00:59.740
Yes.

00:59.740 --> 01:01.520
I will continue to hone my skills,

01:01.520 --> 01:02.520
brother.

01:02.840 --> 01:03.900
That's good.

01:06.720 --> 01:09.980
I've disappointed my brother again.

01:14.600 --> 01:16.680
Thank god.

01:17.060 --> 01:19.560
I did not hurt Naka's adorable face.

01:20.860 --> 01:22.060
Katsuta's Three Great Festivals
at Ogiso High

01:22.060 --> 01:23.480
KATSUTA'S FESTIVALS
Katsuta's Three Great Festivals at Ogiso High

01:23.480 --> 01:25.160
officially begins now.

01:25.800 --> 01:26.480
Today's class competition event

01:26.480 --> 01:27.940
(Episode 9: You and Seal of Culture)
Today's class competition event

01:27.940 --> 01:29.340
(Episode 9: You and Seal of Culture)
is 'Cops and Robbers.'

01:29.620 --> 01:31.340
The competition starts at 2 PM.

01:31.620 --> 01:33.520
Which class

01:33.520 --> 01:35.230
will seize victory?

01:35.860 --> 01:37.480
CREPE, ANIMAL COSTUME CAFE
Is it really okay?

01:38.080 --> 01:39.650
STUDENT COUNCIL
Making Take the sole cop,

01:40.180 --> 01:43.600
and all the other students as robbers.

01:44.140 --> 01:46.541
Isn't it giving too much leeway?

01:46.542 --> 01:47.462
There's no problem.

01:47.820 --> 01:48.817
Most importantly,

01:49.420 --> 01:51.080
ADMISSION APPLICATION
Yokoya Yuki?

01:51.740 --> 01:54.740
She transferred to our school under
the persona of Hitoyoshi Yokoya's cousin.

01:55.180 --> 01:57.680
However, there are several doubts
in her personal history.

01:58.120 --> 01:59.659
Class 1-A.

01:59.660 --> 02:01.380
The same class as Naka?

02:01.720 --> 02:03.640
She has also registered to
participate in today's competition.

02:04.160 --> 02:05.040
Keep an eye on her.

02:05.434 --> 02:06.339
Hmm.

02:06.340 --> 02:10.000
We can't rule out the possibility that
she is secretly an enemy of Hikage.

02:10.460 --> 02:11.360
So,

02:11.940 --> 02:14.800
I'll observe her while I'm on patrol.

02:18.560 --> 02:21.040
Lord Take is actually
going to investigate her

02:21.460 --> 02:22.620
personally.

02:23.180 --> 02:25.400
Perhaps she's not just anybody.

02:25.640 --> 02:26.580
By the way,

02:26.580 --> 02:28.520
do you know the theme of her class?

02:28.740 --> 02:30.460
Uh, I think it's…

02:31.420 --> 02:33.820
Welcome to the Animal Costume Cafe.

02:34.180 --> 02:37.180
Guest, please put on
a set of clothes you like.

02:38.540 --> 02:40.820
Actually, I…

02:41.340 --> 02:44.280
I've never been approved by my brother.

02:44.680 --> 02:47.620
Brother… do you mean President Hikage?

02:47.620 --> 02:48.800
Ah, yes.

02:49.100 --> 02:51.560
Not only does he believe in
the supremacy of strength,

02:51.560 --> 02:53.080
he is also a perfectionist.

02:53.080 --> 02:56.100
However, as his sister, I am frail…

02:56.100 --> 02:58.739
Is that why you want to win?

02:58.740 --> 02:59.589
Yes.

02:59.590 --> 03:01.080
Even if I can't win,

03:01.080 --> 03:03.099
as long as he sees my active side,

03:03.100 --> 03:06.580
perhaps he will acknowledge me a little.

03:07.460 --> 03:08.540
And…

03:10.180 --> 03:12.800
No… nothing.

03:12.800 --> 03:16.740
She has a bit of a communication problem
in front of Miss Yuki.

03:17.440 --> 03:18.240
It's okay.

03:18.240 --> 03:21.140
Thanks to you, Hikage,
we found out what the competition was about.

03:21.420 --> 03:22.340
Yes.

03:22.340 --> 03:24.859
In the game of Cops and Robbers,
the key to victory is athletic ability.

03:24.860 --> 03:27.550
Since each class has to choose
three people to participate…

03:29.300 --> 03:30.930
Mr. Katsuta sauce!

03:32.080 --> 03:33.620
Hi, I'm Super Katsuta.

03:33.620 --> 03:35.060
You're Taiga, right?

03:35.060 --> 03:36.520
Are you competing in this outfit?

03:37.120 --> 03:38.440
Of course.

03:38.440 --> 03:40.600
Super Katsuta is invincible.

03:40.600 --> 03:42.399
Kurokawa.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.300
Just watch.

03:43.300 --> 03:45.940
With the golden trio of
me, Yuki, and Hikage,

03:45.940 --> 03:48.619
we can give that president a good beating.

03:48.620 --> 03:49.740
Speaking of which,

03:49.740 --> 03:53.720
I don't think I've seen Hikage
in PE class that much.

03:54.160 --> 03:55.579
That's because

03:55.580 --> 03:57.800
I don't want to attract attention.

03:59.240 --> 04:01.540
Although I'm not as great as my brother,

04:01.540 --> 04:03.100
I can run pretty fast.

04:03.100 --> 04:05.060
I will do my best.

04:06.260 --> 04:07.820
Please be assured.

04:08.180 --> 04:09.840
Thanks to Miss Hikage,

04:09.840 --> 04:12.860
we are able to see a glimmer of hope.

04:13.200 --> 04:15.279
I will also give it my all.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.640
Let's work together

04:16.640 --> 04:19.426
and beat up the student council president.

04:19.887 --> 04:21.120
Miss Yuki.

04:21.680 --> 04:23.080
Yes… that's right.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.920
If we lose heart before the game starts,

04:24.920 --> 04:27.060
we won't be able to 'beat' my brother.

04:27.060 --> 04:29.080
That's the spirit.

04:29.620 --> 04:30.920
Welcome.

04:30.920 --> 04:32.320
Here is our menu…

04:32.320 --> 04:33.330
Eek!

04:34.700 --> 04:36.600
ANGRY
You deceived Naka,

04:36.600 --> 04:38.460
ANGRY
forced her to speak vulgar language,

04:39.060 --> 04:40.799
and even tried to cause discord between us

04:40.800 --> 04:42.720
to split us from the inside.

04:43.860 --> 04:45.619
Yokoya Yuki.

04:45.620 --> 04:47.060
Unforgivable.

04:49.560 --> 04:52.859
Taiga, are you really going
to compete as Super Katsuta?

04:52.860 --> 04:53.640
Yeah.

04:53.840 --> 04:56.400
Only by katsuta sauce winning
can it be called the Katsuta's Festivals.

04:56.400 --> 04:58.011
I want to attract attention on television

04:58.012 --> 04:58.600
and become the most famous local mascot.

04:58.600 --> 05:00.810
KATSUTA SAUCE
and become the most famous local mascot.

05:01.280 --> 05:02.939
What an unrealistic idea.

05:02.940 --> 05:04.340
Ah… right.

05:04.340 --> 05:05.780
The TV station will also come.

05:06.180 --> 05:08.240
Can Miss Yuki appear on camera?

05:08.900 --> 05:10.300
Miss Yuki…

05:10.300 --> 05:13.340
Ah, brother, Miss Yuki.

05:13.340 --> 05:15.180
I've been looking for you both.

05:15.520 --> 05:17.900
I asked Kobachi, and he told me
you were slacking off.

05:17.900 --> 05:19.100
You guys are delinquents.

05:19.420 --> 05:22.100
We were helping out
at the cafe this morning.

05:22.100 --> 05:23.899
We have no shifts this afternoon.

05:23.900 --> 05:25.640
And Miss Yuki has to
participate in a competition.

05:25.640 --> 05:28.420
So you won't be at the cafe anymore?

05:28.600 --> 05:30.380
-No…
-Sorry, Riko.

05:31.780 --> 05:33.860
Just make do with Kobachi this year.

05:33.860 --> 05:35.340
Don't pick me up.

05:35.340 --> 05:39.240
Kobachi, you must feel
very lonely being left out.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.180
Don't pat my head, Taiga.

05:41.180 --> 05:42.840
Enough, I'm going back to the store.

05:43.300 --> 05:44.520
Sorry, Kobachi.

05:44.520 --> 05:47.760
They really are good friends.

05:47.760 --> 05:48.840
Yes.

05:50.880 --> 05:51.740
Um,

05:52.080 --> 05:56.200
Yuki, do you have any friends?

05:56.700 --> 05:58.160
Friends?

05:58.160 --> 05:59.320
Ah.

05:59.320 --> 06:03.980
It sounds like I'm saying
you don't have friends.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.160
Um,

06:07.160 --> 06:09.300
the person without friends

06:09.300 --> 06:11.100
is actually me.

06:11.860 --> 06:14.039
If you don't mind,

06:14.040 --> 06:15.120
um,

06:17.420 --> 06:20.320
could you… be friends

06:21.180 --> 06:24.540
with me?

06:25.300 --> 06:26.279
Okay.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.400
Let's

06:28.000 --> 06:29.139
be friends.

06:32.140 --> 06:35.580
-Miss Yuki, Riko wants to go to the cultural festival.
-Friends.

06:35.860 --> 06:36.680
Okay.

06:36.940 --> 06:38.280
I'll go with you.

06:38.740 --> 06:40.459
What about Hikage?

06:40.460 --> 06:41.440
Do you want to come along?

06:41.440 --> 06:45.280
Um, I still have some things
to investigate.

06:49.200 --> 06:51.080
You two seemed happy just now.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.480
What were you talking about?

06:55.800 --> 06:57.060
Master Hitoyoshi.

06:58.180 --> 06:59.620
What kind of relationship

06:59.980 --> 07:02.340
is friendship?

07:02.700 --> 07:03.620
Eh?

07:05.840 --> 07:07.700
To be friends with Yuki.

07:08.280 --> 07:09.640
Friends.

07:10.220 --> 07:13.340
Even if Yuki finds out my true nature,

07:13.340 --> 07:15.500
she would probably still
want to be friends with me.

07:15.980 --> 07:17.280
For that,

07:17.280 --> 07:21.360
I must win the competition
to show her that I can be of help.

07:22.940 --> 07:25.520
The meeting room of
the Katsuta's Festivals Executive Committee

07:25.880 --> 07:27.700
is a bit far away.

07:28.260 --> 07:30.720
But as long as I concentrate,
I should still be able to hear.

07:32.160 --> 07:33.579
The competition

07:33.580 --> 07:34.560
rules?

07:39.360 --> 07:40.520
What?

07:43.300 --> 07:45.640
Finally, it's time for today's main event,

07:45.640 --> 07:49.160
the class competition, Cops and Robbers.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.720
Let me introduce a special guest.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.980
Miss Nazca.

07:51.980 --> 07:54.180
All Katsuta enthusiasts,

07:54.180 --> 07:56.160
do you regularly savor the sauce?

07:56.160 --> 07:57.800
I am Nazca.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.920
The rules of the competition
are very simple.

08:03.920 --> 08:07.420
As long as President Hikage, as the police,
locks all the thieves in jail,

08:07.420 --> 08:08.560
the police side wins.

08:08.560 --> 08:11.140
Conversely, if even one thief
manages to escape, the thieves win.

08:11.140 --> 08:13.420
Additionally, any thief
who is locked in jail

08:13.420 --> 08:16.840
can escape if touched
by a fellow classmate playing a thief.

08:16.840 --> 08:19.727
Wouldn't it be
too advantageous for the thieves?

08:19.728 --> 08:20.500
Yes.

08:20.500 --> 08:23.980
So, Miss Nazca
will announce the additional rule.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.166
Okay.

08:25.167 --> 08:27.440
The new rule is…

08:28.620 --> 08:30.920
Everyone participating in the game

08:30.920 --> 08:35.620
must wear their class's themed costume.

08:35.980 --> 08:37.260
I'm sorry.

08:37.261 --> 08:39.960
If I had obtained
this information earlier,

08:39.960 --> 08:42.280
perhaps I could have found a solution.

08:42.540 --> 08:44.720
It's fine for me, but you two…

08:45.240 --> 08:48.180
I was planning to
go with this look anyway.

08:50.780 --> 08:52.700
The so-called 'friend' is…

08:54.960 --> 08:56.020
Miss Hikage.

08:56.020 --> 08:57.700
You don't need to apologize.

08:58.680 --> 09:00.220
The so-called friend

09:00.220 --> 09:03.140
is to help out
when the other party is in trouble.

09:03.500 --> 09:06.660
Let us unite our efforts
and overcome your brother.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.360
Miss Yuki.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.300
And…

09:10.940 --> 09:13.279
Although it hinders movement,
it can cover your face.

09:13.280 --> 09:15.800
It would be troublesome
if underground assassins like Grace saw you.

09:16.100 --> 09:20.560
Master Hitoyoshi said it'd be
best for me not to be filmed.

09:21.140 --> 09:23.200
Super Katsuta, go!

09:23.540 --> 09:26.700
Wearing an animal costume
makes it easier for me to move.

09:26.920 --> 09:29.700
Alright, is everyone ready?

09:30.060 --> 09:32.178
The competition lasts fifteen minutes.

09:32.179 --> 09:36.540
Which class will be able to
overthrow President Hikage?

09:41.680 --> 09:43.080
My little sister

09:43.320 --> 09:45.060
is so cute!

09:56.160 --> 09:57.740
Is anything wrong?

09:57.740 --> 09:59.120
Sorry.

09:59.120 --> 10:02.360
I feel like if I look at my brother now,
I won't be able to move.

10:02.820 --> 10:04.120
I was rejected.

10:04.540 --> 10:06.600
Why do you hide
behind that kind of person?

10:06.600 --> 10:07.560
Naka?

10:09.200 --> 10:11.400
She is… Yokoya Yuki.

10:11.780 --> 10:13.940
I see, Yokoya Yuki.

10:13.940 --> 10:15.520
So you're the cause of it all.

10:15.780 --> 10:17.700
Your sins are grave and unforgivable.

10:18.200 --> 10:21.162
This year's president is truly daunting.

10:21.162 --> 10:22.622
He's very motivated.

10:22.622 --> 10:24.760
These rules are disadvantageous
to the president,

10:24.760 --> 10:26.417
but I still feel a bit uneasy.

10:26.417 --> 10:28.631
Come on, Miss Yuki!

10:28.951 --> 10:30.760
So, all you thieves,

10:30.760 --> 10:32.720
please disperse yourselves.

10:34.240 --> 10:36.312
Why is Take so angry?

10:36.313 --> 10:37.313
Who knows?

10:37.640 --> 10:39.200
Wanome siblings.

10:39.200 --> 10:41.840
That's under police jurisdiction.

10:42.920 --> 10:45.840
Turning oneself in doesn't
break the rules, right?

10:46.834 --> 10:50.140
Sorry, as the student council,
we don't allow anyone to get hurt.

10:50.514 --> 10:53.880
We will support the president
from within the prison.

10:54.561 --> 10:55.881
Just start the game.

10:56.600 --> 10:58.140
Eh, ah…

10:58.140 --> 10:59.240
Okay.

10:59.400 --> 11:00.654
Then…

11:00.655 --> 11:03.355
The game starts now?

11:05.100 --> 11:06.040
So fast!

11:12.360 --> 11:14.640
Oh, that's really unexpected!

11:14.640 --> 11:17.380
It's a super heavyweight offensive!

11:17.700 --> 11:20.140
What's that, a human bulldozer?

11:20.140 --> 11:21.440
I'm wondering too.

11:21.660 --> 11:23.460
It's like a hot knife through butter.

11:23.460 --> 11:25.640
The thieves have no strength to fight.

11:27.014 --> 11:29.100
Oh, and right now,

11:29.580 --> 11:32.640
there are only three people
left on the field after three minutes.

11:32.880 --> 11:35.880
That's the trio from class 1A,
the Animal Costume Cafe.

11:35.880 --> 11:38.900
Yes! Mr. Katsuta, go for it!

11:40.558 --> 11:42.958
Nazca is watching me.

11:43.560 --> 11:45.080
She has expectations of me.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.680
That's right, I am now Super Katsuta.

11:48.400 --> 11:51.300
First of all, I'll take your head.

11:51.300 --> 11:52.620
Because I am…

11:52.620 --> 11:55.460
Super Katsuta!

11:57.900 --> 12:00.600
The sin of deceiving Naka is quite heavy.

12:01.540 --> 12:02.880
Yokoya Yuki!

12:06.160 --> 12:07.380
Yuki.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.280
Let's split up.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.340
No.

12:10.740 --> 12:12.140
It seems it's already too late.

12:19.300 --> 12:20.340
Yuki!

12:23.820 --> 12:25.780
What's with this grip strength?

12:26.460 --> 12:27.420
So,

12:28.860 --> 12:31.720
now you really have nowhere to escape.

12:33.880 --> 12:35.640
What should I do? I have to run away.

12:36.080 --> 12:36.730
But…

12:37.733 --> 12:38.633
Okay.

12:38.633 --> 12:39.780
Let's

12:40.180 --> 12:41.080
be friends.

12:45.920 --> 12:47.640
This cloud of smoke is…

12:54.620 --> 12:55.880
What in the world

12:55.880 --> 12:58.220
has happened?

12:58.220 --> 12:59.840
It's an illusion.

13:00.180 --> 13:03.160
At the moment a large cloud
of smoke appeared on the field,

13:03.420 --> 13:06.800
the person thrown out
somehow became 'Rabbit.'

13:07.553 --> 13:10.439
That was… Hikage…

13:10.440 --> 13:12.501
The so-called friend

13:12.502 --> 13:15.192
is someone you can do
silly things with… I guess.

13:15.873 --> 13:16.993
Silly things.

13:16.994 --> 13:19.094
Oh… that is just an example.

13:19.600 --> 13:21.540
I think there should be
all kinds of friendships.

13:21.834 --> 13:25.513
The three of us have been
called 'The Three Stooges'.

13:25.514 --> 13:29.020
Do people have to
know each other long to be friends?

13:29.260 --> 13:31.580
I don't think that's true.

13:31.580 --> 13:32.460
Hmm.

13:32.928 --> 13:36.644
There was a time
when I was very self-destructive.

13:36.645 --> 13:39.005
Only they stayed with me
through thick and thin.

13:39.380 --> 13:42.219
They have changed my life;
I am really grateful to them.

13:42.220 --> 13:44.900
I hope that one day, when they need help,

13:45.140 --> 13:48.193
I can contribute for them.

13:48.194 --> 13:51.020
Perhaps this is what friends
are all about for me.

13:54.320 --> 13:56.220
Could you… be friends

13:56.220 --> 13:58.280
with me?

13:59.340 --> 14:01.960
What friends mean to me…

14:03.140 --> 14:04.400
Naka.

14:06.420 --> 14:08.320
Don't be reckless, Naka.

14:08.740 --> 14:10.180
It's just a cultural festival.

14:10.660 --> 14:11.640
No.

14:16.301 --> 14:19.121
This is very important to me.

14:24.666 --> 14:27.346
It has been ten minutes
since Rabbit was thrown out.

14:27.639 --> 14:30.120
The president has ceased all movements.

14:30.120 --> 14:32.420
What exactly happened?

14:32.700 --> 14:37.160
Is this a standoff between the strong
where the first one to act loses?

14:37.160 --> 14:39.980
-I threw Naka…
-I feel like he took a big hit.

14:39.980 --> 14:42.440
-How can it be… What did I…
-And he can't wrap his head around it.

14:42.440 --> 14:44.060
What concerns me more

14:44.060 --> 14:46.520
is that Miss Yuki seems not
to be focused on the game.

14:47.880 --> 14:48.700
Naka was…

14:49.240 --> 14:51.839
The top priority is to win the game.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.820
I just have to hold on
for two more minutes.

14:54.240 --> 14:55.160
The problem is

14:55.560 --> 14:57.690
I need to find a way not
to be caught on camera.

14:58.580 --> 14:59.960
More importantly,

15:00.240 --> 15:01.040
that man has the scent of

15:01.040 --> 15:03.500
katsuta sauce emanating from him.

15:04.160 --> 15:06.660
Is that a strategy to
prevent me from escaping?

15:08.080 --> 15:09.440
I mustn't underestimate him.

15:09.740 --> 15:11.440
But that woman

15:11.440 --> 15:13.689
can fight back and forth with Take.

15:13.690 --> 15:16.030
Yes, she is very strong.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.060
Yuki.

15:18.060 --> 15:20.470
Keep it up!

15:25.200 --> 15:27.700
Both sides finally broke the deadlock.

15:28.061 --> 15:30.740
Who is the Wolf

15:30.740 --> 15:32.440
that can match the president in strength?

15:32.655 --> 15:34.750
I can't push her away at all.

15:35.131 --> 15:38.020
Takoyaki, Okonomiyaki, Fried noodles.

15:38.020 --> 15:39.340
I'm hungry.

15:39.340 --> 15:42.080
I don't know what your intentions are.

15:42.500 --> 15:47.053
But your attempt to sever the ties and bonds
between my sister and me, the Hikage clan,

15:47.053 --> 15:49.560
will never succeed.

15:50.840 --> 15:52.340
Tonight's dinner is…

15:53.260 --> 15:54.920
But what I can't stand the most…

16:01.440 --> 16:05.480
is you approaching my sister
under the guise of a friend.

16:05.800 --> 16:08.520
For my sister, a friend is very special.

16:08.823 --> 16:11.223
What do you know about her?

16:11.680 --> 16:12.430
No.

16:12.430 --> 16:16.079
You know nothing of
my sister's hardships and pain.

16:16.080 --> 16:19.740
Sooner or later, you will plunge
my sister into deeper despair.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.580
Special…

16:24.020 --> 16:28.130
What kind of relationship
does 'friend' refer to?

16:29.020 --> 16:30.260
Friend.

16:30.424 --> 16:33.504
Before such a thing happens,
I will remove you from her sight…

16:37.720 --> 16:38.660
What…

16:39.684 --> 16:41.084
She threw Take out.

16:41.380 --> 16:42.502
Amazing.

16:42.502 --> 16:46.000
The Wolf effortlessly gave
the muscular president a judo throw!

16:46.000 --> 16:48.400
Who is this Wolf?

16:48.400 --> 16:49.480
Bastard.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.400
Do you think you can escape now?

16:52.560 --> 16:54.000
Despicable!

16:54.000 --> 16:55.440
Twenty seconds remaining.

16:55.440 --> 16:58.320
Is the Wolf planning
to rescue a companion?

16:58.800 --> 16:59.780
Miss Yuki.

17:05.735 --> 17:06.615
Naka.

17:07.748 --> 17:12.720
At that time, I responded to your request
without knowing what a friend means.

17:13.160 --> 17:16.100
But now I have
a slightly better understanding.

17:16.660 --> 17:19.800
Because I, too,
have someone very special to me.

17:20.280 --> 17:23.620
If I could become a special being for you,

17:24.080 --> 17:25.620
I would be very happy to.

17:26.440 --> 17:28.700
So… Would you be willing

17:29.120 --> 17:31.880
to become my friend again?

17:33.462 --> 17:34.242
Uh…

17:34.765 --> 17:36.705
Eh?

17:42.639 --> 17:44.779
The match is over!

17:45.389 --> 17:46.820
In the very end,

17:46.820 --> 17:48.960
a furious battle unfolded.

17:50.390 --> 17:51.130
Eh?

17:51.381 --> 17:52.863
So who is the winner?

17:52.863 --> 17:54.940
Our class should have won.

17:54.940 --> 17:57.360
She touched Hikage,
so she saved one person.

17:57.998 --> 17:59.553
Miss Yuki understood this before…

17:59.553 --> 18:02.860
But look, both of them are in jail now.

18:03.140 --> 18:07.211
When the whistle blew,
Miss Yuki was also in jail, right?

18:07.211 --> 18:08.840
Don't tell me

18:08.840 --> 18:11.920
Miss Yuki doesn't
understand the rules at all.

18:12.240 --> 18:14.302
KATSUTA'S FESTIVALS
The winner is President Hikage.

18:14.302 --> 18:16.530
KATSUTA'S FESTIVALS
Class 2-E, led by the student council president,

18:16.530 --> 18:18.200
KATSUTA'S FESTIVALS
has won the championship for two consecutive years.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.040
Okay.

18:26.040 --> 18:28.480
I'm going to conduct an interview now.

18:28.480 --> 18:30.163
Take care.

18:30.163 --> 18:31.180
We're going to do an interview too.

18:31.180 --> 18:31.920
Yes.

18:31.920 --> 18:33.193
Oh no.

18:33.194 --> 18:34.920
404 NOT FOUND
Miss Yuki's mind has stopped working,

18:34.920 --> 18:37.010
404 NOT FOUND
so her face will be exposed.

18:37.300 --> 18:39.300
President, Wolf,

18:39.300 --> 18:41.400
please give us your thoughts on this game.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.560
Camera.

18:42.560 --> 18:46.200
Master Hitoyoshi said it'd be
best for me not to be filmed.

18:48.440 --> 18:50.820
I… I need to help Yuki.

18:54.725 --> 18:56.820
Wow, there's smoke again.

18:56.820 --> 18:57.940
Darn you.

18:57.940 --> 18:59.700
What did you make my sister do…

19:00.420 --> 19:02.700
Yikes, Muscle King Kong!

19:03.680 --> 19:05.882
Darn it, where is that woman?

19:05.882 --> 19:08.820
Where is Miss Yuki?
I can't see anything in this smoke.

19:08.820 --> 19:10.140
What happened…

19:10.140 --> 19:11.280
Yokoya.

19:12.240 --> 19:13.940
Yuki is wearing Super Katsuta's costume.

19:14.240 --> 19:15.080
Eh?

19:15.490 --> 19:17.920
Let's take her away from here.

19:17.920 --> 19:18.820
Mhm.

19:18.820 --> 19:20.000
Riko, come help.

19:20.000 --> 19:21.240
Got it.

19:26.850 --> 19:27.960
I'm sorry.

19:27.960 --> 19:30.140
I made us to lose the game.

19:30.140 --> 19:33.400
No, it's because I got the wrong idea.

19:36.360 --> 19:38.020
Because at that time,

19:38.700 --> 19:41.200
I was wholeheartedly trying to help Naka.

19:42.640 --> 19:45.440
I also wanted you to like me.

19:45.900 --> 19:50.280
So, whether it's reflection or affection,
let's share them.

19:51.547 --> 19:52.447
Okay.

19:52.890 --> 19:53.790
Naka.

19:54.779 --> 19:55.902
Brother.

19:55.903 --> 19:57.520
You must be exhausted too.

19:57.858 --> 19:59.118
Let's go home.

19:59.514 --> 20:00.860
Okay…

20:02.240 --> 20:05.900
Whenever there's a chance,
she would hit on Naka.

20:06.300 --> 20:07.940
I must be watchful.

20:08.258 --> 20:09.238
Forget it.

20:09.834 --> 20:11.919
If I see you disrupt the order again,

20:11.919 --> 20:13.975
I will not let you off easily.

20:13.975 --> 20:15.260
Yokoya Yuki.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.540
Then I will take my leave.

20:19.228 --> 20:20.148
Naka.

20:21.460 --> 20:24.060
See you at school then.

20:27.950 --> 20:29.100
Yes.

20:29.100 --> 20:30.396
See you at school.

20:45.341 --> 20:46.241
Miss Yuki.

20:47.620 --> 20:48.998
Master Hitoyoshi.

20:48.998 --> 20:50.240
Aren't you going to the concert?

20:50.860 --> 20:53.060
I want to stay here…

20:55.320 --> 20:56.380
Miss Yuki.

20:56.700 --> 20:57.580
Well,

20:58.209 --> 20:59.240
are you okay?

20:59.240 --> 21:00.020
Eh?

21:00.320 --> 21:04.800
I'm wondering if you're feeling down
because you didn't win the match.

21:08.561 --> 21:10.640
I should feel indignant
about losing the match,

21:10.640 --> 21:13.680
but now, another emotion
remains in my heart.

21:14.180 --> 21:15.380
Actually, long before this,

21:15.660 --> 21:20.060
ever since I knew about the Katsuta's Festivals,
my emotions have been fluctuating.

21:20.060 --> 21:21.799
I felt restless.

21:21.800 --> 21:25.440
It's a bit different than
when I'm with you.

21:26.040 --> 21:28.460
But at the moment
when the outcome is decided,

21:28.700 --> 21:30.540
what I first felt was…

21:33.240 --> 21:35.720
Do you wish the cultural festival
wouldn't end?

21:39.860 --> 21:41.008
From my point of view,

21:41.008 --> 21:43.220
it seems like you've
been enjoying yourself.

21:43.640 --> 21:46.200
You were so engrossed that
you even got the rules wrong.

21:48.280 --> 21:49.380
I see.

21:50.300 --> 21:51.600
So,

21:52.740 --> 21:56.280
I've been enjoying myself.

21:58.020 --> 21:59.800
It's over, isn't it?

22:00.180 --> 22:01.360
The cultural festival.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.840
This was our first cultural festival.

22:05.260 --> 22:08.180
Even though we lost this year,
there's still next year.

22:08.639 --> 22:09.662
Next year?

22:09.662 --> 22:11.914
Next time, let's come up
with an even better strategy.

22:11.914 --> 22:14.360
We must win against the president's class.

22:14.980 --> 22:18.320
I've never thought about next year.

22:19.150 --> 22:21.910
Perhaps at the next moment,
I will be killed.

22:22.485 --> 22:26.885
The reality I live in is only
a story within a dream.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.551
Here,

22:29.552 --> 22:31.139
there's still a tomorrow.

22:31.140 --> 22:33.680
There are all sorts of possibilities.

22:34.160 --> 22:36.880
Here, it is possible to plan
what to eat for dinner tonight

22:37.220 --> 22:41.720
and to make plans
for the next appointment.

22:42.758 --> 22:44.918
Speaking of which, I'm hungry.

22:45.498 --> 22:47.740
For dinner, I want to
eat fried pork cutlet.

22:47.740 --> 22:49.000
What about you, Miss Yuki?

22:51.440 --> 22:52.740
That's right.

22:54.657 --> 22:56.617
I'd also like to eat fried pork cutlet.
